### core: how do certification tests run in CI (replay-integrity steps)?
name: Replay Integrity
    - name: Checkout code
    - name: Setup Node.js
    - name: Install dependencies
      run: npm ci
    - name: Run dependency validator
      run: npx ts-node tools/dependency-guard/dependency-validator.ts runtime/replay
    - name: Run replay tests
      run: npm run replay:test
    - name: Check for forbidden imports in replay kernel
      run: |
